From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fogtape <lilixu3210@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] src: expose required ECH for TLS and QUIC clients

Expose echConfigList and authenticated acceptance without plaintext-SNI
fallback. Use OpenSSL native peer verification for ECH, suppress QUIC
0-RTT, and report the accepted ECH status through TLS and QUIC APIs.

Ported to Node 27's TLS and QUIC callback layouts from the reviewed Node 26
implementation. The App requires this path for its mandatory ECH/H3 sources.

Assisted-by: Codex
